{
  "id": "playground-turns",
  "title": "操場輪流玩",
  "titleEn": "Taking Turns on the Playground",
  "category": "校園活動",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/playground-turns.webp",
    "alt": "下課時的校園操場上，小學生們在紅色溜滑梯旁乖乖排隊輪流玩耍，旁邊有盪鞦韆與草地，大家都笑得很開心。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The children have fun together on the "
        },
        {
          "text": "playground",
          "wordIds": [
            "playground"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "孩子們在學校操場上一起開心地玩耍。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "84533cc6fc22aaf7752d336bf42efe576026095a6fbf69bb2f6a44b43a12d5df",
        "sha256": "74ab818293ad3d7608d382ff9921f02767b103f45890f2f323090b3ef1d24673"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Amy swings high on the "
        },
        {
          "text": "swing",
          "wordIds": [
            "swing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and Leo walks to the big "
        },
        {
          "text": "slide",
          "wordIds": [
            "slide"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Amy 在鞦韆上盪得很高，Leo 則走向大溜滑梯。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "5645977b63325784dd6d3668097d6283be9e8418ea3166f6ead63de6d1b52077",
        "sha256": "fbbfc2491f7f44a67883cbb130238242d4537ee4fb4e1010dabeab772c02c72d"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo smiles at Mia and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can I play too?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-play-too"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 對著 Mia 微笑並問：「我也可以一起玩嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "2e55790d9020d4085769b1ab462d70d365585745a8474adf880e49cae6c3a9fb",
        "sha256": "d0e3d98bbb94f4b7d87f92752725261338a842f2e12cb522d2344e15a44b62dc"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia nods and says, “Yes! "
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's wait in ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-wait-in-line"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "line",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-wait-in-line"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "line"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-wait-in-line"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 點點頭說：「好啊！我們一起排隊吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "902428fbf824d75da92e6e40ce5913d06d0fd821b17550eacecdfd26c81ef049",
        "sha256": "9e326430b4b08ffc55a34dce26d34aa348a08647131dad6c29aa91964976699a"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo waits patiently and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is it my ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "is-it-my-turn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "turn",
          "phraseIds": [
            "is-it-my-turn"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "turn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "is-it-my-turn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 耐心地排隊等待，並問：「輪到我了嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "bc1e1accd8e93b4c16d7c215c2c0cc0bbefe10c8d34eb181ce9fc4bb3d780ac3",
        "sha256": "c064ef242b1e045686a1d2692c7cb4f30be07f31f1a81eea5cfcfa7c153c91ee"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "its-your-turn-now"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "turn",
          "phraseIds": [
            "its-your-turn-now"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "turn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " now.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "its-your-turn-now"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 微笑著說：「現在輪到你了。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "bdc3fb6f07627f0d4aebad35148144f77907c63febd4d6e693469203728d0013",
        "sha256": "77369da894eab0783fe955fa91f3c7fad77e3071b37ab5da21b4e9e281c29d93"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo slides down the "
        },
        {
          "text": "slide",
          "wordIds": [
            "slide"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the children are "
        },
        {
          "text": "happy",
          "wordIds": [
            "happy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to play together."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 從溜滑梯滑下來，孩子們很開心能一起玩耍。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/playground-turns/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "657998f070bb3e44d47ccce4dd5bf510d1f4ca79fef488a6797ef4ecf5f112af",
        "sha256": "480e82b0b7f599e54aced6b98008fccfa29f9f6a33339288a71731464942b46b"
      }
    }
